= Oracle (blockchain) — Technical =

Oracle design specifies data sources, reporter identities, aggregation, freshness, cryptographic authentication, dispute/fallback logic, and the adversary model. Security failures can arise from source manipulation, reporter collusion, stale data, market manipulation, governance compromise, or differences between the measured and intended quantity.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* oracle ≠ truth source by definition
* decentralized oracle ≠ assumption-free oracle
* oracle data ≠ native blockchain state

